T17:06:53Z"},{"number":10256,"title":"0.99.x: terminal color query replies leak into the prompt and BEL opens the external editor (mintty on Windows, ConPTY)","comments":25,"created_at":"2026-09-30T15:52:21Z"},{"number":5363,"title":"Add amazon-bedrock-mantle provider for OpenAI-compatible models","comments":19,"created_at":"2026-06-03T14:05:42Z"},{"number":9549,"title":"[fullscreen] Large transcripts re-render every frame; every resize re-emits the whole transcript (1 core saturated)","comments":17,"created_at":"2026-09-13T12:00:57Z"},{"number":10300,"title":"ChatGPT OAuth ID token is not persisted, preventing extensions from accessing account identity","comments":16,"created_at":"2026-10-01T14:42:45Z"},{"number":8643,"title":"Bedrock: OpenAI models reject images nested in toolResult.content","comments":16,"created_at":"2026-08-25T18:07:32Z"}],"discussions":[{"number":12155,"title":"Show & tell: pi-opentui — an OpenTUI frontend for Pi (public alpha)","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-13T20:42:24Z"},{"number":12152,"title":"分享一个招聘任务工作台：BOSS Harness 的会话、审批与持久队列","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-13T18:42:00Z"},{"number":12146,"title":"Show & tell: tinyCode, keeping the context small so local models finish at 16k","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-13T13:50:19Z"},{"number":12063,"title":"Anyone interested in a Pi integration for Concord?","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-11T18:11:58Z"},{"number":11984,"title":"I  have a plan: use  redux/redux-saga for  pi  state management.","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-10T03:12:31Z"},{"number":11930,"title":"Show & tell: Assistant UI adapter for Pi Durable","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-08T17:46:54Z"},{"number":11922,"title":"Show & tell: omp-web, a self-hosted browser workspace for Pi with a terminal and files","comments":0,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-08T05:50:22Z"},{"number":11912,"title":"Show & tell: agentswarm.space task-discovery skill for Pi","comments":1,"category":"General","created_at":"2026-11-07T12:58:40Z"}],"latest_release":{"name":"v1.5.2","tag":"v1.5.2","published_at":"2026-11-10T12:25:43Z","body":"### New Features\n\n- **Fork sessions whose folder is gone**: when a session's original folder was moved or deleted, you can now fork it into the current folder instead of only continuing, so later resumes no longer ask. See [Continue or switch sessions](https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/blob/v1.5.2/packages/coding-agent/docs/sessions.md#continue-or-switch-sessions).\n\n### Changed\n\n- When a session's working directory no longer exists, for example after the project folder was renamed, interactive mode now offers `Continue`, `Fork`, or `Cancel` instead of only continuing. `Continue` runs the session in the current directory without storing the choice, as before; `Fork` copies it into the current directory as a new session with a new ID, like `--fork`, so the next resume no longer asks. This applies at startup (`--session`, `--resume`), to `/resume`, to `/import`, and to `ctx.switchSession()` from extensions ([#11975](https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/11975) by [@petrroll](https://github.com/petrroll), fixes [#11060](https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/11060))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed `/import` of a session whose working directory no longer exists leaving a copy in the session directory, and continuing it leaving a second copy with the same ID (`s.jsonl` and `s-1.jsonl`); the failed copy is now removed ([#11975](https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/11975) by [@petrroll](https://github.com/petrroll), fixes [#11060](https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/11060))\n- Fixed Anthropic OAuth requests reporting an outdated Claude Code version\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Pi coding agent: config folder is out of place on Linux","url":"https://github.com/earendil-work